<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 82 FOR FIVE AT LUNCH V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 82 FOR FIVE AT LUNCH V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The West Indies were 82 for five at lunch on the first day of their fourth test match against Australia at the Adelaide Oval on Saturday.</p>
<p>Score - West Indies 82 for five at lunch after 28 overs (Glenn McGrath two for 21, Shane Warne two for 17.)</p>
